    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d204-a12">

                <pb facs="0342" n="240" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg240"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Chinandega</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-05-25"><hi rendition="#italic">May 25,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush">His Excellency <hi rendition="#small-caps">The
                        President</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">San Jose, Costa Rica:</hi></p>
                <p>The municipality and the multitude of neighbors of this city are at this moment
                    celebrating the inauguration of the court of justice for Central America, and
                    through me they desire to felicitate Your Excellency upon this happy
                    undertaking, <pb facs="0343" n="241" xml:id="pg241"/> predicting that, while
                    foreign intervention was necessary to bring about the treaty of peace between
                    the five sections of Central America, it will never be necessary for its
                    maintenance.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Roberto Gonzales</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Alcalde.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
